                                                 (eStamp.message || eStamp) + ') — retrying once');
                                })) {
                            tickStampsFailed++; // still failed after the retry
                        }
                    } catch (e) {
                        // Same failure mode as before gh-1107 (E2 included —
                        // an unwritable temp dir degrades identically):
